{"hw":"ἐγγυητός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐγγυητός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐγγυ-ητός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, always of a wife, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">plighted, wedded</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐγγυητὴ γυνή</span>, opp. to an <span class=\"gk\">ἑταίρα</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Is.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.77</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">59.60</span> </span>.</div></div>"}